1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:03,252
اَعُوْذُ بِاللهِ مِنَّ الشِّيْطَانِ الرَّجِيْمِ۞

2
00:00:03,387 --> 00:00:05,532
بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمَانِ الرَّحِيْمَ۞

3
00:00:05,556 --> 00:00:11,222
اَلْحَمْدُ لله ، وَالصَّلَاةُ وَالسَّلَامُ عَلى سَيِّدِنَا محمد وَعَلَى اَلِهِ وَصَحْبِهِ وَسَلِّمْ تَسْلِيْمًا كَثِيْرا

4
00:00:13,226 --> 00:00:18,891
The next important event is the marriage of Rasool Allah ﷺ to Khadijah(خديجه).

5
00:00:19,226 --> 00:00:26,036
Khadijah(خديجه) was a well known and prosperous woman in Makkah, she was wealthy,

6
00:00:26,529 --> 00:00:30,418
she wasn't married, she was older in age.

7
00:00:31,669 --> 00:00:37,006
And she used to hire men to travel for her and do business.

8
00:00:37,398 --> 00:00:38,097
Because you know that

9
00:00:38,168 --> 00:00:44,847
the trade of the people of Makkah used to be based on traveling to Yemen and Syria, Ash-sham(الشام).

10
00:00:45,306 --> 00:00:49,246
Allahسبحانه وتعالى describes that, in Surah(سورة) Quraish(قُرَيْشْ):

11
00:00:49,482 --> 00:00:52,328
لِإِيلَافِ قُرَيْشٍ۝إِيلَافِهِمْ رِحْلَةَ الشِّتَاءِ وَالصَّيْفِ۝

12
00:00:52,695 --> 00:00:55,864
    فَلْيَعْبُدُوا رَبَّ هَٰذَا الْبَيْتِ۝الَّذِي أَطْعَمَهُمْ مِنْ جُوعٍ وَآمَنَهُمْ مِنْ خَوْفٍ۝

13
00:00:55,952 --> 00:00:58,084
They had the journey of winter and the journey of summer,

14
00:00:58,586 --> 00:01:00,913
one to Yemen and one to Ash-Sham(الشام).

15
00:01:02,023 --> 00:01:05,782
So, Khadijah(خديجه) would hire men to work for her and take care of her business.

16
00:01:06,404 --> 00:01:10,132
She happened to hire Muhammadﷺ, she heard about his honesty,

17
00:01:10,745 --> 00:01:14,066
she was running into trouble with a lot of men not being honest.

18
00:01:14,610 --> 00:01:18,153
So, she wanted to hire somebody who was trustworthy.

19
00:01:18,769 --> 00:01:21,624
She heard about Muhammadﷺ, so she hired him,

20
00:01:22,262 --> 00:01:25,536
and she had her servant accompany Muhammadﷺ.

21
00:01:26,772 --> 00:01:28,578
Her servant's name is Mesarah(ميسرا),

22
00:01:28,906 --> 00:01:33,381
Muhammadﷺ  went to Ash-Sham(الشام) did business for her, came back.

23
00:01:33,860 --> 00:01:36,801
Mesarah(ميسرا) reported back to his master.

24
00:01:37,285 --> 00:01:39,582
Mesarah(ميسرا) went to Khadijah(خديجه) and told her:

25
00:01:39,745 --> 00:01:44,887
This man, his trustworthiness and honesty is amazing, it's outstanding,

26
00:01:45,966 --> 00:01:47,985
and he was praising Muhammadﷺ.

27
00:01:48,688 --> 00:01:52,715
Well, Khadijah(خديجه) became very interested in Muhammadﷺ

28
00:01:52,791 --> 00:01:56,021
I mean, his character was admirable.

29
00:01:57,424 --> 00:02:00,572
Khadijah رضي الله عنها, who was a wealthy woman,

30
00:02:00,883 --> 00:02:03,550
who was sought after by the noble men of Quraish(قُرَيْشْ),

31
00:02:04,701 --> 00:02:06,749
she said: I want to marry you,

32
00:02:07,802 --> 00:02:09,831
and Rasool Allah ﷺ agreed.

33
00:02:11,038 --> 00:02:15,629
Rasool Allah ﷺ was 25 and she was 40,

34
00:02:15,932 --> 00:02:18,008
the difference was 15 years.

35
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:26,265
She was his senior and Rasool Allah ﷺ never married anyone else

36
00:02:26,655 --> 00:02:29,837
before Khadijah رضي الله عنها passed away.

37
00:02:31,429 --> 00:02:37,502
All of the surviving children of Rasool Allah ﷺ were from Khadijah(خديجه),

38
00:02:37,566 --> 00:02:41,168
Fatimah(فاطمه) was the daughter of Khadijah رضي الله عنها.

39
00:02:41,444 --> 00:02:43,602
She bore six children for him.

40
00:02:43,872 --> 00:02:46,395
Zainab(زينب), Ruqaiyah(رقيّه), Umm Kalsoom(ام كلثوم), Fatimah(فاطمه),

41
00:02:46,693 --> 00:02:48,424
Al-Qasim(القاسم) and Abdullah(عبدالله).

42
00:02:49,046 --> 00:02:52,933
And none of them ended up having descendants except Fatimah رضي الله عنها.

43
00:02:53,264 --> 00:02:57,184
And that is where the lineage of Rasool Allah ﷺ is continuing

44
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:59,970
through the descendants of Fatimah(فاطمه) and Ali(علي).

45
00:03:00,635 --> 00:03:09,928
Rasool Allah ﷺ loved her so much, and Rasool Allah ﷺ kept his loyalty to Khadijah(خديجه), even after she passed away,

46
00:03:10,365 --> 00:03:13,623
 he would always remember her, always mention her name

47
00:03:14,348 --> 00:03:20,159
and that sometimes would cause jealousy among the other wives of Rasool Allah ﷺ.

48
00:03:20,768 --> 00:03:27,664
But Rasool Allah ﷺ had so much love and admiration to Khadijah(خديجه) and so much respect for her

49
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:34,974
because Khadijah(خديجه) is the one, who stood up for him and supported him,

50
00:03:35,774 --> 00:03:38,759
when everybody else betrayed Muhammadﷺ.

51
00:03:39,584 --> 00:03:46,332
Ayesha رضي الله عنها, who was the most beloved to Rasool Allah ﷺ, after that, she would sometimes feel this jealousy.

52
00:03:46,411 --> 00:03:47,753
 In Bukhari(بخاريْ) and Muslim(مسلم), it says that

53
00:03:47,814 --> 00:03:49,570
Ayesha(عائشه) said:

54
00:03:49,958 --> 00:03:54,529
I did not become jealous of any of the wives of the Prophet صلى الله عليه وسلم except Khadijah(خديجه)

55
00:03:55,221 --> 00:03:56,544
and I have not seen her.

56
00:03:57,925 --> 00:04:00,980
The Messenger of Allah used to, at times slaughter a sheep and say

57
00:04:01,006 --> 00:04:02,984
send it to the Friends of Khadijah(خديجه).

58
00:04:03,766 --> 00:04:06,391
So, not only did Rasool Allah ﷺ always remember her,

59
00:04:06,765 --> 00:04:11,416
he kept on maintaining a relationship with the friends of Khadijah(خديجه).

60
00:04:13,012 --> 00:04:14,963
And one day I angered him,

61
00:04:15,003 --> 00:04:16,312
when he said that

62
00:04:16,439 --> 00:04:19,235
by replying out to jealousy, Khadijah(خديجه),

63
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:23,579
so he ﷺ said: I have been given by Allah her love.

64
00:04:24,066 --> 00:04:27,097
Once he mentioned the name of Khadijah(خديجه), so Ayesha(عائشه) was upset.

65
00:04:27,716 --> 00:04:32,932
Rasool Allah ﷺ responded and said: This is something from Allah, I was given her love.

66
00:04:33,582 --> 00:04:37,805
It's not something that I control, Allah has put her love in my heart.

67
00:04:38,321 --> 00:04:43,286
In another Hadith(حديث) narrated by Ahmad(احمد) and Tirimdhi(ترمذي), Ayesha رضي الله عنها said:

68
00:04:43,630 --> 00:04:49,440
The Messenger of Allah used to, many times not leave his home without praising Khadijah(خديجه),

69
00:04:49,563 --> 00:04:50,563
I mean, this is amazing.

70
00:04:51,277 --> 00:04:53,142
How much love Rasool Allah ﷺ had for her.

71
00:04:53,435 --> 00:04:57,194
One of the days he praised her and out of jealousy, I said:

72
00:04:57,665 --> 00:05:03,116
Was she not but an elder woman that Allah has replaced her for you, with what is better?

73
00:05:04,427 --> 00:05:11,407
He became angered and said: No, by Allah, He did not replace me with anyone better.

74
00:05:12,047 --> 00:05:15,448
For she had faith in me, when the people rejected,

75
00:05:15,883 --> 00:05:18,504
she believed me, when the people belied me,

76
00:05:18,922 --> 00:05:23,804
she made comfortable with what she had, when the people denied me,

77
00:05:24,139 --> 00:05:26,613
and Allah has blessed me with children from her.

78
00:05:27,562 --> 00:05:29,784
So, Rasool Allah ﷺ would become angry,

79
00:05:30,145 --> 00:05:34,011
when he would hear anything against Khadijah رضي الله عنها.

80
00:05:34,382 --> 00:05:38,143
And this shows us an aspect of the personality of Rasool Allah ﷺ,

81
00:05:39,002 --> 00:05:41,825
his loyalty to the people who were close to him.

82
00:05:42,192 --> 00:05:44,454
This is years after Khadijah(خديجه) passed away.

83
00:05:44,917 --> 00:05:48,486
I mean, opportunist people, they take advantage of a person

84
00:05:48,551 --> 00:05:51,841
and whenever that person is gone, that's the end of the relationship.

85
00:05:52,599 --> 00:05:58,046
Rasool Allah ﷺ would always remember his old friends, old relatives

86
00:05:58,213 --> 00:06:02,268
 Hamza Bin Abdul Muttalib(حمزه بن عبدالمطلب), Khadijah رضي الله عنها, Mus'ab Bin Umair(مصعب بن عمير),

87
00:06:02,913 --> 00:06:09,053
these Sahabah(صحابه), in fact, Subhaan Allah(سُبْحَان الله), one amazing thing that brings the person to tears.

88
00:06:10,043 --> 00:06:14,898
Before Rasool Allah ﷺ passed away, one of the last things he did.

89
00:06:15,406 --> 00:06:20,062
Was go and visit the cemetery of his friends, who died in the Battle of Uhud(احد).

90
00:06:20,777 --> 00:06:24,402
The 70 companions, who died in the Battle of Uhud(احد),

91
00:06:24,785 --> 00:06:27,959
when Rasool Allah ﷺ felt that he will be leaving Duniyah(دُنِيَّا) soon,

92
00:06:28,458 --> 00:06:31,553
he went to the cemetery and made Dua(دُعَا) for them

93
00:06:32,433 --> 00:06:36,031
and he was saying in that Dua(دُعَا) that soon we will meet.

94
00:06:36,448 --> 00:06:38,531
Rasool Allah ﷺ was missing them so much.

95
00:06:39,047 --> 00:06:45,583
And was asking Allah سبحانه وتعالى to bring him with them and to join them together in Jannah(جنة).

96
00:06:47,401 --> 00:06:52,735
So, Rasool Allah ﷺ have this strong relationship with his Sahabah(صحابه) and loyalty,

97
00:06:53,052 --> 00:06:58,563
and he never forgot his wife Khadijah(خديجه), who stood with him in moments of difficulty,

98
00:06:58,755 --> 00:07:03,914
he never forgot that and he would continuously make Dua(دُعَا) for her and mention her name.

99
00:07:04,448 --> 00:07:09,293
And Khadijah(خديجه) was a special person, Khadijah رضي الله عنها,

100
00:07:10,331 --> 00:07:15,977
when she was living Jibril(جبريل) descended on Muhammadﷺ and said:

101
00:07:17,629 --> 00:07:21,571
Khadijah(خديجه) is going to approach you now and she's carrying for you some food

102
00:07:22,321 --> 00:07:27,480
When she arrives, tell her that Allah is giving her Salam(سلام)

103
00:07:28,473 --> 00:07:31,330
and tell her that I am giving her Salam(سلام).

104
00:07:32,019 --> 00:07:33,722
That is how special Khadijah(خديجه) was.

105
00:07:34,137 --> 00:07:40,429
Allahسبحانه وتعالى sends down Jibreel عليه السّلام, to tell Khadijah(خديجه) that I'm giving Salam(سلام) to you.

106
00:07:41,548 --> 00:07:45,473
And Jibreel(جِبْرِيْل) is then adding his own Salam(سلام) to the statement

107
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:50,311
and telling Muhammadﷺ and tell her that Jibreel(جِبْرِيْل) is giving her, his Salam(سلام).

108
00:07:51,117 --> 00:07:53,847
And then Jibreel عليه السّلام said:

109
00:07:54,226 --> 00:07:58,946
And give her the glad tidings of a palace in paradise.

110
00:07:59,556 --> 00:08:01,937
So, she was granted a place in Jannah(جنة).

111
00:08:02,729 --> 00:08:07,120
Khadijah(خديجه) is one of the four Greatest Women that ever lived.

112
00:08:07,671 --> 00:08:13,253
Rasool Allah ﷺ says that the greatest women that ever set foot on the face of the earth are four,

113
00:08:13,984 --> 00:08:15,286
Maryam Bint Imran(مريم بنت عمران),

114
00:08:15,856 --> 00:08:17,357
Khadijah Bint Khuwailid(خديجه بنت خويلد),

115
00:08:17,853 --> 00:08:19,212
Fatimah Bint Muhammad(فاطمه بنت محمد)

116
00:08:19,587 --> 00:08:21,182
and Aasiya Bint Muzahim(آسيه بنت مزاحم).

117
00:08:22,222 --> 00:08:23,380
These are the greatest women.

118
00:08:23,904 --> 00:08:28,653
The greatest among them is Maryam عليها السّلام by the verse in Qur'an.

119
00:08:29,340 --> 00:08:41,642
وَإِذْ قَالَتِ الْمَلَائِكَةُ يَا مَرْيَمُ إِنَّ اللَّهَ اصْطَفَاكِ وَطَهَّرَكِ وَاصْطَفَاكِ عَلَىٰ نِسَاءِ الْعَالَمِينَ۝

120
00:08:41,854 --> 00:08:46,204
O Maryam(مريم) Allah has chosen you, above all of the women of the world

121
00:08:47,036 --> 00:08:48,469
by the statement of Qur'an.

122
00:08:49,279 --> 00:08:54,146
Second, is Khadijah(خديجه), she's number two, the second greatest women,

123
00:08:54,339 --> 00:08:59,154
number three, Fatima Bint Muhammad(فاطمه بنت محمد), and number four, Aasiya Bint Muzahim(آسيه بنت مزاحم)

124
00:09:00,674 --> 00:09:03,948
and all of these four women had something to do with a Nabi(نبي).

125
00:09:04,747 --> 00:09:10,191
Two of them were Mothers of Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء), or actually ones, who brought up Ambiyaa(أنبِيَاء),

126
00:09:11,341 --> 00:09:13,278
Maryam عليها السّلام brought up Eesa(عيسى),

127
00:09:13,959 --> 00:09:17,086
she was his mother and Aasiya(آسيه) she brought up Musa(موسى).

128
00:09:17,652 --> 00:09:22,610
And then Khadijah(خديجه) was a wife of a Nabi(نبي) and Fatimah(فاطمه) was the daughter of a Nabi(نبي).

129
00:09:26,586 --> 00:09:32,920
Rasool Allah ﷺ, number one reached the age of 25.

130
00:09:35,009 --> 00:09:43,892
And he was, Yaani(يعني) in his seerah(سيرة), Rasool Allah ﷺ was known as being chaste

131
00:09:44,985 --> 00:09:47,576
in an environment that is corrupt.

